  "content": "<center><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sFx7o7p.png\" alt=\"標題\" /></p></center>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1158094?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/deimos?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Deimos 是一個 Minecraft 資料生成與設定函式庫。有了它，你可以生成設定檔，並在 Forge 和 Neoforge 中原生顯示於遊戲內，或在 Fabric 上藉助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a> 顯示。Deimos 讓你在遊戲啟動時建立新的合成配方，使這些配方可設定化。這也意味著你無需使用 JSON 檔案，並且切換 Minecraft 版本會變得更加容易且不那麼麻煩。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">此函式庫的設定部分基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\">MidnightLib</a>，由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/motschen/projects\">Motschen</a> 製作。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">我製作這個模組是為了簡化我自己的模組開發，並讓我能跨所有模組載入器和 Minecraft 版本使用統一的設定函式庫。如果你想看看實際應用中如何使用此函式庫的範例，可以查看<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/MarsThePlanet\">我製作的模組</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/laser-bridges-and-doors\"><img alt=\"雷射橋與門\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1195/185/64/64/638770736607588151_animated.gif\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wishful-recipes\"><img alt=\"願望配方\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1821/680/64/64/639150887771985409.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-music-discs\"><img alt=\"更多唱片\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/369/955/64/64/637539954760044673.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/server-side-horror\"><img alt=\"伺服器端恐怖\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1380/4/64/64/638895109610009518.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exp-counter\"><img alt=\"經驗值計數器\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/179/64/64/638752204531779528.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fire-arrows-ignite-fire\"><img alt=\"火焰箭點火\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSoi1ek.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/flat-exp-costs\"><img alt=\"固定經驗消耗\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1314/641/64/64/638854870713185428.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lava-turns-sand-into-glass\"><img alt=\"熔岩將沙變成玻璃\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/182/64/64/638752210189574617.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cooked-carrots\"><img alt=\"烤胡蘿蔔\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tFPjbhV.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/husks-drop-sand\"><img alt=\"屍殼掉落沙\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/376/68/64/64/637552001848895633.png\" /></a> \n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p></center>\n<h1>給開發者</h1>\n<p>以下是設定與使用 Deimos 的說明。關於此函式庫的更多詳細資訊，請務必查閱其 <a href=\"https://github.com/Mars-The-Planet/Deimos\">GitHub 頁面</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"setup\">設定</h2>\n<p>你可以使用我的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Mars-The-Planet/Multiloader-Templates-with-Deimos\">IntelliJ 模板</a>，這些模板會產生一個已預先配置 Deimos 的新 MultiLoader 專案，或依照以下說明手動設定：</p>\n<h3 id=\"in-your-build-gradle-\">在 build.gradle 中</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">repositories</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-section\">maven</span> {\n        url = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://api.modrinth.com/maven\"</span>\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"forge-and-neoforge-\">Forge 和 Neoforge：</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">dependencies</span> {\n    implementation <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"maven.modrinth:deimos:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.deimos_version}</span>\"</span>\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"fabric-\">Fabric：</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">dependencies</span> {\n    modImplementation <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"maven.modrinth:deimos:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.deimos_version}</span>\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 如果你想使用 Mod Menu</span>\n    modCompileOnly <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"com.terraformersmc:modmenu:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.modmenu_version}</span>\"</span>\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>如果你想使用 Mod Menu 功能，則需要新增一個資料庫：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">repositories</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-section\">maven</span> {\n        name = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Terraformers\"</span>\n        url = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://maven.terraformersmc.com/\"</span>\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos/versions\">Modrinth</a> 找到所需的特定 Deimos 版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-use-it\">如何使用</h2>\n<h3 id=\"creating-configs\">建立設定檔</h3>\n<p>你可以在繼承 DeimosConfig 的類別中新增設定：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">public <span class=\"hljs-class\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">TestConfig</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">DeimosConfig</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Entry</span> public static int test_int = <span class=\"hljs-number\">6</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Entry</span> public static <span class=\"hljs-type\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span>&gt; test_string_list = <span class=\"hljs-type\">Lists</span>.newArrayList(\n            <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"minecraft:acacia_planks\"</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"minecraft:andesite\"</span>);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>接著在你的初始化方法中，你需要像這樣呼叫 DeimosConfig.init：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">DeimosConfig</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.init</span>(<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">MOD_ID</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">TestConfig</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.class</span>);\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"adding-new-recipes\">新增合成配方</h3>\n<p>要新增合成配方，你可以在初始化方法中呼叫 DeimosRecipeGenerator 的方法。你可以新增無序合成、有序合成、熔煉、煙燻、高爐、營火和切石機配方。以下是一些範例：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">DeimosRecipeGenerator.createSmeltingJson(TestConfig.test_string_list.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>), TestConfig.test_string_list.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>), TestConfig.test_int, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.5</span>F);\n\nDeimosRecipeGenerator.createShapedRecipeJson(\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'#'</span>),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(ResourceLocation.parse(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"sand\"</span>)),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(\n                <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"# \"</span>,\n                <span class=\"hljs-string\">\" #\"</span>\n        ),\n        ResourceLocation.parse(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"stone\"</span>), <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\n</code></pre>\n<p>請注意，你可以使用設定檔中的值。如果玩家變更這些值並重新啟動遊戲，合成配方也會隨之改變。\n這甚至適用於模組物品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
